   "summary": "Support Me ♥",
   "description": "<h2>Support Me &hearts;<br />Your support is truly vital to keep this and my other linux projects alive, so it would be great if you consider becoming a supporter on any of the different platforms, any help means a lot<br /><br />- <a href=\"https://github.com/sponsors/eliverlara\">Become a sponsor on github</a><br />- <a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/eliverlara\">Become a sponsor on Ko-fi</a><br />- <a href=\"https://www.paypal.com/paypalme/eliverlara\">Donate using PayPal</a><br /><br />Sweet gradient icon theme originally created to fit my <a href=\"https://www.gnome-look.org/p/1253385/\">Sweet</a> theme<br /><br />If you want you can combine them with any of the options provided in <a href=\"https://www.opendesktop.org/p/1284047/\">sweet-folders</a> as shown in the second screenshot<br /><br /><b>Note</b><br /><br />To request for icons please <a href=\"https://github.com/EliverLara/candy-icons/issues\">open an issue</a> on github, or if you want to contribute open a <a href=\"https://github.com/EliverLara/candy-icons/pulls\">pull request</a></h2>",
