   "summary": "Papirus - it's free and open source ... ",
   "description": "<p>Papirus - it's free and open source SVG-based icon theme for Linux with material and flat style.<br />All elements have clear distinction and outlines. Also main feature - it's jucy colors tone.<br /><br />Papirus support hardcode-tray script:<br /><a href=\"https://github.com/bil-elmoussaoui/Hardcode-Tray/\">https://github.com/bil-elmoussaoui/Hardcode-Tray/</a><br /><br />Folder Color support:<br /><a href=\"http://foldercolor.tuxfamily.org\">http://foldercolor.tuxfamily.org</a><br /><br />Dolphin Folder Color support:<br /><a href=\"https://github.com/audoban/dolphin-folder-color\">https://github.com/audoban/dolphin-folder-color</a><br /><br />Papirus Folders script:<br /><a href=\"https://github.com/PapirusDevelopmentTeam/papirus-folders\">https://github.com/PapirusDevelopmentTeam/papirus-folders</a><br /><br />And KDE color scheme:<br /><a href=\"https://techbase.kde.org/Development/Tutorials/Plasma5/ThemeDetails#Colors\">https://techbase.kde.org/Development/Tutorials/Plasma5/ThemeDetails#Colors</a><br /><br />ANDROID Version available here:<br /><a href=\"https://www.pling.com/p/1662847/\">https://www.pling.com/p/1662847/</a></p>",
